  m_Name: TestDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  characterName: Bartender
  textLines:
  - "Listen, pal, I ain't in the business of askin\u2019 too many questions\u2014just
    pourin\u2019 drinks and keepin\u2019 secrets. You want a whiskey neat, I\u2019ll
    slide it your way. You want somethin\u2019 a little stronger, well\u2026 let\u2019s
    just say I know a guy. "
  - "But if you\u2019re bringin\u2019 trouble through that door, do me a favor\u2014finish
    your drink first. Bloodstains are hell to get outta the floorboards, and the
    boss don\u2019t like a mess."
